global_

# Cs3Cr2Br9, P 63/m m c, k = (1/4, 1/4, 0): magnetic intensities of the
# CrysFML example Testing/Magnetism/CCB.cfl + CCB.int (MagOptim, FullProf
# convention, Irrep with BASR of Cr: C = (0, 0, 1.12064) μB), github.com/rozyczko/CrysFML08.
# Converted by Crystal.add_propagation_vector(0.25, 0.25, 0, "Cr", irrep=2):
# Γ2 of the group of k is the representation of CrysFML. The scale is fixed
# (it correlates with the moment), the moment along c is refined.
# The reflections of CCB.int (integer hkl, k number 1 = +k, 2 = -k) are
# written as fractional indices H = hkl ± k. Structure from CCB.cfl.

